WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.19 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Stewardship and retention

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Look after supporters after they give: thank, report honestly and listen.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Thank quickly, and use money as promised.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Plan updates and reports for each supporter segment.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Measure retention and ask lapsed supporters why.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita: Meera calls retail chains after every delivery; online buyers get a thank-you card naming the weaver.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a stewardship plan for each supporter segment.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
